WEBVTT

00:00:06.689 --> 00:00:08.809
-(GASPING)
-Things get sillier

00:00:08.889 --> 00:00:10.849
and sillier and then you die.

00:00:11.009 --> 00:00:12.809
(LAUGHING)
I don't wanna die.

00:00:12.969 --> 00:00:14.649
Ah, nobody does. (GRUNTS)

00:00:15.529 --> 00:00:16.609
Really.

00:00:16.689 --> 00:00:19.009
(CHUCKLES) Not such
a bad way to go.

00:00:23.009 --> 00:00:24.449
(SCREAMING)

00:00:28.169 --> 00:00:29.329
(INHALING RAPIDLY)

00:00:34.049 --> 00:00:35.049
(GRUNTS)

00:00:36.489 --> 00:00:37.609
(ALL GASP)

00:00:37.729 --> 00:00:39.969
Everyone, we need to get
to the back of the ship.

00:00:40.129 --> 00:00:42.449
All supers,
protect your ambassadors!

00:00:43.409 --> 00:00:44.769
Follow.

00:00:47.969 --> 00:00:49.929
Dad's been underwater
for too long.

00:00:50.009 --> 00:00:51.409
(ALARM BLARING)

00:00:58.089 --> 00:00:59.609
We gotta pull him up.

00:00:59.769 --> 00:01:01.169
Wait. It's too soon.

00:01:07.769 --> 00:01:08.889
(GRUNTS)

00:01:15.249 --> 00:01:16.529
I'm gonna press the button!

00:01:16.689 --> 00:01:17.689
Not yet!

00:01:19.129 --> 00:01:20.689
(METAL CREAKING)

00:01:27.609 --> 00:01:29.169
(STRAINING)

00:01:32.769 --> 00:01:34.489
It's turning. It's working.

00:01:38.369 --> 00:01:40.329
-Now!
-Dash, now!

00:01:43.529 --> 00:01:44.849
Save yourself. Make a chute.

00:01:47.609 --> 00:01:49.249
-(MR. INCREDIBLE GRUNTS)
-Make a chute. Make a chute.

00:01:49.409 --> 00:01:50.449
Make a chute!

00:01:50.889 --> 00:01:52.129
-(ELASTIGIRL YELLS)
-(VOYD YELPS)

00:01:53.249 --> 00:01:55.049
LUCIUS: Helen!
Brace yourselves!

00:02:03.249 --> 00:02:04.849
Crash positions!

00:02:06.209 --> 00:02:07.809
(GRUNTING)

00:02:10.049 --> 00:02:11.809
(PEOPLE SCREAMING)

00:02:21.969 --> 00:02:23.409
(ALL SIGHING)

00:02:23.489 --> 00:02:24.569
Whoo.

00:02:25.209 --> 00:02:29.009
(GASPS) I missed
Jack-Jack's first power?

00:02:29.209 --> 00:02:31.529
Actually, you missed
the first 17.

00:02:31.609 --> 00:02:33.209
-(ALL LAUGHING)
-ELASTIGIRL: Oh!

00:02:33.289 --> 00:02:34.689
(JACK-JACK BABBLING)

00:02:36.089 --> 00:02:37.929
(PEOPLE APPLAUDING)

00:02:38.969 --> 00:02:40.289
(JACK-JACK GIGGLES)

00:02:45.129 --> 00:02:48.649
The fact that you saved me
doesn't make you right.

00:02:49.649 --> 00:02:51.369
But it does make you alive.

00:02:51.569 --> 00:02:53.009
And I'm grateful for that.

00:02:53.529 --> 00:02:55.849
I'm sorry,
but she'll go to prison.

00:02:56.609 --> 00:02:57.929
Well, I'm sorry she's rich

00:02:58.009 --> 00:03:00.449
and will probably get no more
than a slap on the wrist.

00:03:00.609 --> 00:03:03.369
First of all, Violet,
I like you.

00:03:03.529 --> 00:03:06.129
And who knows
what the future may bring...

00:03:06.329 --> 00:03:09.489
but I have a good feeling
about all of you.

00:03:09.929 --> 00:03:11.609
Hmm. Good feeling.

00:03:11.689 --> 00:03:13.249
-Should we be worried?
-(MR. INCREDIBLE CHUCKLES)

00:03:13.329 --> 00:03:15.609
You guys got the next shift.
I'm beat. Oh!

00:03:15.969 --> 00:03:17.729
I saw what you did back there.
That was incredible!

00:03:17.889 --> 00:03:19.129
No pun intended.

00:03:19.289 --> 00:03:20.769
VIOLET: Sorry I had
to punch you.

00:03:20.889 --> 00:03:22.369
(TIRES SCREECH)

00:03:22.489 --> 00:03:25.809
Yeah, baby! My sweet ride!

00:03:28.369 --> 00:03:29.649
(CHUCKLES NERVOUSLY)

00:03:32.009 --> 00:03:33.329
(CHUCKLES)

00:03:34.089 --> 00:03:35.929
-(INDISTINCT CHATTER)
-(ALL CHEERING)

00:03:38.249 --> 00:03:41.609
And in recognition
of the extraordinary service

00:03:41.689 --> 00:03:42.809
they have demonstrated...

00:03:42.969 --> 00:03:45.409
the legal status
of superheroes

00:03:45.489 --> 00:03:47.609
is hereby restored.

00:03:47.689 --> 00:03:50.129
(ALL CHEERING)

00:03:51.489 --> 00:03:53.249
(CHILDREN CHATTERING
IN DISTANCE)

00:03:56.649 --> 00:03:58.449
You don't know me, do you?

00:03:58.609 --> 00:03:59.769
No, I don't...

00:03:59.969 --> 00:04:01.289
Wait.

00:04:01.449 --> 00:04:03.209
Are you the girl
with the water?

00:04:03.369 --> 00:04:04.969
I'm Violet Parr.

00:04:05.889 --> 00:04:07.449
-I'm Tony.
-(CHUCKLING) Okay.

00:04:07.609 --> 00:04:09.969
You split up into
separate groups and stuff...

00:04:18.289 --> 00:04:20.689
-Tony, this is my mom.
-Pleased to meet you.

00:04:20.849 --> 00:04:22.849
-This is my dad.
-BOB: Oh, we've met.

00:04:23.009 --> 00:04:24.969
And this is embarrassing.

00:04:25.129 --> 00:04:26.209
(IN BRITISH ACCENT)
Charmed, I'm sure.

00:04:26.369 --> 00:04:28.409
-My little brother, Dash.
-(TOY SQUEAKS)

00:04:28.569 --> 00:04:30.449
VIOLET: And the baby
is Jack-Jack.

00:04:30.609 --> 00:04:33.729
I tried to limit it
to one parent.

00:04:33.889 --> 00:04:36.289
We're all going to a movie,
too, Tony. Don't mind us.

00:04:36.449 --> 00:04:37.449
BOB: We'll be sitting

00:04:37.529 --> 00:04:38.689
on the other side
of the theater.

00:04:38.849 --> 00:04:40.409
Not watching you.

00:04:40.489 --> 00:04:42.529
(LAUGHING) He's kidding.

00:04:42.609 --> 00:04:45.369
They are only dropping us off
at the theater.

00:04:45.529 --> 00:04:48.209
They have other things to do.

00:04:48.369 --> 00:04:50.809
So, you guys are close,
I guess.

00:04:50.969 --> 00:04:53.089
-Yeah, I guess.
-We can get closer.

00:04:53.249 --> 00:04:54.689
(LAUGHING) Bob.

00:04:54.769 --> 00:04:56.169
(INDISTINCT CHATTER)

00:04:58.209 --> 00:04:59.769
-(GUNSHOTS)
-(PEOPLE SCREAMING)

00:05:09.289 --> 00:05:10.409
Stop! Let us out!

00:05:10.569 --> 00:05:12.129
Here, large popcorn,
small soda.

00:05:12.289 --> 00:05:14.329
Save me a seat, center,
about eight rows back.

00:05:14.849 --> 00:05:17.769
I'll be back before
the previews are over.

00:05:31.889 --> 00:05:34.609
(UPBEAT MUSIC PLAYING)

